# {{PROJECT_NAME}}

Instructions for AI coding agents (Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, ...) working in this repository.

## Project

* Unreal Engine **{{ENGINE_VERSION}}**, **{{PROJECT_TYPE}}** project
* Project file: `{{PROJECT_NAME}}.uproject`
* Startup map: `{{MAIN_MAP}}`
* Game module: `Source/{{PROJECT_NAME}}` (C++ projects), base game mode `A{{PROJECT_NAME}}GameMode`

## Repository layout

```
+- Config/             engine/game ini files (DefaultEngine.ini, DefaultGame.ini, ...)
+- Content/            assets (.uasset/.umap are binary - never edit them as text)
+- Source/             C++ code
+- devops_ue/          git submodule with automation scripts (do not modify from this repo)
+- devops_data/        local devops config: config.bat (EnginePath, COPYRIGHT_LINE, ...)
+- .claude/skills/     devops skills for Claude Code (.agents/skills/ - the same for Codex / OpenCode / Antigravity)
+- *.bat               shortcuts to devops_ue scripts
```

## Common tasks

| Task | Command |
|------|---------|
| Generate IDE project files | `generate_project_files.bat` |
| Format all C++ sources | `format_all_files.bat` (uses `.clang-format`) |
| Clean Intermediate/Binaries/Saved/... | `clean_intermediate_files.bat` |
| Run automation tests | `run_tests.bat` |
| Package the game | `package_game.bat` (output: `Build/`) |
| Client/Server targets | `devops_ue\targets\create_client_target.bat`, `create_server_target.bat` |
| New test / spec file | `devops_ue\tests\create_test_file.bat`, `create_spec_file.bat` |

All scripts read paths from `devops_data\config.bat`.

## Code conventions

* Every `.h`, `.cpp`, `.cs` file starts with the copyright line:
  ```
  {{COPYRIGHT_LINE}}
  ```
* Format code with `.clang-format` (Allman braces, 4 spaces, 140 columns) before committing.
* Unreal naming: `A` actors, `U` UObjects/components, `F` structs, `E` enums, `I` interfaces, `b` prefix for bools.
* Use `{{PROJECT_NAME}}_API` for exported classes; keep headers minimal and prefer forward declarations.
* After adding/removing C++ files run `generate_project_files.bat`.

## Do not

* Do not commit `Binaries/`, `Intermediate/`, `Saved/`, `DerivedDataCache/`, `Build/`.
* Do not edit files inside `devops_ue/` - change them upstream in the devops_ue repository.
* Do not hand-edit binary assets (`.uasset`, `.umap`).
